000010* USE BEFORE REPORTING: declaratives before a detail line, a
000020* control heading, a control footing (with SUPPRESS PRINTING),
000030* the FINAL footing and the report footing. Expected output is
000040* checked by hand, not stock: with a detail declarative stock
000050* 3.2 restarts GENERATE, doubling SUM totals (DECISIONS.md).
000060 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000070 PROGRAM-ID. REPORT3.
000080 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000090 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000100 FILE-CONTROL.
000110     SELECT PRINTF ASSIGN TO "report3.txt"
000120        ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
000130 DATA DIVISION.
000140 FILE SECTION.
000150 FD PRINTF REPORT IS SALES-RPT.
000160 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000170 01 WS-DEPT        PIC X(6).
000180 01 WS-NAME        PIC X(10).
000190 01 WS-AMT         PIC 9(5)V99.
000200 01 DETAILS-SEEN   PIC 99 VALUE 0.
000210 01 BIG-SALE       PIC X(4).
000220 REPORT SECTION.
000230 RD SALES-RPT
000240    CONTROLS ARE FINAL WS-DEPT
000250    PAGE LIMIT 30 LINES
000260    HEADING 1 FIRST DETAIL 3 LAST DETAIL 26 FOOTING 28.
000270 01 TYPE PAGE HEADING.
000280    05 LINE 1.
000290       10 COLUMN 10 PIC X(19) VALUE "SALES BY DEPARTMENT".
000300 01 DEPT-HEAD TYPE CONTROL HEADING WS-DEPT.
000310    05 LINE PLUS 2.
000320       10 COLUMN 2 PIC X(5) VALUE "DEPT".
000330       10 COLUMN 8 PIC X(6) SOURCE WS-DEPT.
000340 01 DETAIL-LINE TYPE DETAIL.
000350    05 LINE PLUS 1.
000360       10 COLUMN 4 PIC X(10) SOURCE WS-NAME.
000370       10 COLUMN 16 PIC ZZ,ZZ9.99 SOURCE WS-AMT.
000380       10 COLUMN 27 PIC X(4) SOURCE BIG-SALE.
000390 01 DEPT-TOTAL TYPE CONTROL FOOTING WS-DEPT.
000400    05 LINE PLUS 1.
000410       10 COLUMN 4 PIC X(10) VALUE "DEPT TOTAL".
000420       10 COLUMN 16 PIC ZZ,ZZ9.99 SUM WS-AMT.
000430 01 GRAND-TOTAL TYPE CONTROL FOOTING FINAL.
000440    05 LINE PLUS 2.
000450       10 COLUMN 4 PIC X(11) VALUE "GRAND TOTAL".
000460       10 COLUMN 15 PIC ZZZ,ZZ9.99 SUM WS-AMT.
000470 01 END-OF-REPORT TYPE REPORT FOOTING.
000480    05 LINE PLUS 2.
000490       10 COLUMN 4 PIC X(13) VALUE "END OF REPORT".
000500 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000510 DECLARATIVES.
000520 BEFORE-DETAIL SECTION.
000530     USE BEFORE REPORTING DETAIL-LINE.
000540 BEFORE-DETAIL-PARA.
000550     ADD 1 TO DETAILS-SEEN
000560     IF WS-AMT > 150
000570        MOVE "BIG" TO BIG-SALE
000580     ELSE
000590        MOVE SPACES TO BIG-SALE
000600     END-IF
000610     DISPLAY "BEFORE DETAIL " DETAILS-SEEN " " WS-NAME.
000620 BEFORE-HEAD SECTION.
000630     USE BEFORE REPORTING DEPT-HEAD.
000640 BEFORE-HEAD-PARA.
000650     DISPLAY "BEFORE HEADING " WS-DEPT.
000660 BEFORE-TOTAL SECTION.
000670     USE BEFORE REPORTING DEPT-TOTAL.
000680 BEFORE-TOTAL-PARA.
000690     DISPLAY "BEFORE DEPT TOTAL " WS-DEPT
000700     IF WS-DEPT = "ADMIN"
000710        DISPLAY "  (SUPPRESSED)"
000720        SUPPRESS PRINTING
000730     END-IF.
000740 BEFORE-GRAND SECTION.
000750     USE BEFORE REPORTING GRAND-TOTAL.
000760 BEFORE-GRAND-PARA.
000770     DISPLAY "BEFORE GRAND TOTAL".
000780 BEFORE-END SECTION.
000790     USE BEFORE REPORTING END-OF-REPORT.
000800 BEFORE-END-PARA.
000810     DISPLAY "BEFORE REPORT FOOTING".
000820 END DECLARATIVES.
000830 MAIN SECTION.
000840 MAIN-PARA.
000850     OPEN OUTPUT PRINTF
000860     INITIATE SALES-RPT
000870     MOVE "SALES" TO WS-DEPT
000880     MOVE "ADAMS" TO WS-NAME MOVE 100.50 TO WS-AMT
000890     GENERATE DETAIL-LINE
000900     MOVE "BAKER" TO WS-NAME MOVE 200 TO WS-AMT
000910     GENERATE DETAIL-LINE
000920     MOVE "ADMIN" TO WS-DEPT
000930     MOVE "CLARK" TO WS-NAME MOVE 50.25 TO WS-AMT
000940     GENERATE DETAIL-LINE
000950     MOVE "IT" TO WS-DEPT
000960     MOVE "DAVIS" TO WS-NAME MOVE 300 TO WS-AMT
000970     GENERATE DETAIL-LINE
000980     TERMINATE SALES-RPT
000990     DISPLAY "DETAILS SEEN " DETAILS-SEEN
001000     CLOSE PRINTF
001010     STOP RUN.
